├── mobility_profile.py      (Simulates movement data)
├── lz_trie.py               (LZ-78 Trie implementation)
├── prediction.py            (Predicts movement paths)
├── resource_manager.py      (Energy saving logic)
├── comfort_model.py         (Comfort score evaluation)
```

